message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the paper below."
title: "Lean 4 formalization of 'Higher-Order Defects of Cycle-Index Polynomials' and further theorems on weighted permutation sequences"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kallat
    given-names: Ahaan
