abstract: "Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of the connected-cumulant classification of higher-order defects of cycle-index polynomials, together with the lift at every prime, the odd-prime closed formula, eventual divisibility, the Lagrange family and the OEIS conjectures of Hanna, Richman and Bala."
